  "notes": "All in-run times in SECONDS. Wave `time` = minute*60 and is the START of that wave; each wave runs until the next. `spawnIntervalSeconds` is the shipped `frequency` field (milliseconds) converted to seconds. `minEnemiesOnScreen` is the shipped `minimum` field: the game tops the field up to at least this many enemies. Event `delay` and `duration` likewise converted from ms to seconds; `chancePercent` is a 0-100 percentage as shipped. Treasure `chances` is shipped as [5-item%, 3-item%, 1-item%] and has been split into named fields. `knockbackResistance` holds the shipped `knockback` field, which is a knockback-TAKEN multiplier (higher = knocked back further), so despite the schema key name a HIGHER number means LESS resistance; GHOST/XLMANTIS/XLMUMMY/XLFLOWER at 0 are immune, and the Reaper's -0.5 is negative. Enemy `health`/`power`/`xpDropped` are the raw shipped values; see conflicts about the ~10x wiki display discrepancy.",
